; PrismNet NFS client (stage 1, read-only) against the Synology export
; 192.168.1.10:/volume1/amigatest. Needs L:prismnfs-handler, nfstest and
; the NAS reachable. See docs/NFSCLIENT.md.
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Mount DH0:PrismNet/nfs/PN0
DH0:PrismNet/nfstest PN0: FILE=smb2fs.m68k-amigaos.lha PARENT
List PN0:
Info PN0:
C:PrismNet NETSTAT
NFSDismount PN0:
